==Battleground==
*6 [[Lione Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 16.67~30 seconds<sup>500f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Lione Hippoe]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Lione Hippoe]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*1 [[Sister Lione]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you want to beat this level you will need 3-4 meatshields. Cats that can [[Freeze|freeze]] Sister Lione are also highly recommended.

If you have cats that outrange Sister Lione, bring them. Do not bring [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]] who can easily get hit by her, as they die easily.

